# Weapon cell: Colossus Hall entered with the AXE. The inputs of w4_l2b.inputs: the hero walks over the axe at the
# checkpoint whatever he brings, so the fight is the same.
# w4_l2b "Colossus Hall" (Expert) from '@' through the Wall Colossus to a trophy (ticks:KEYS, keys L R U D F K).
# Whatever weapon the hero brings, he walks over the axe at the checkpoint (only thrown weapons hurt the Colossus), so
# this route plays the same with the club, the hammer, the axe and the swirling axe (w4_l2b.axe.inputs and
# w4_l2b.hammer.inputs are copies; w4_l2b.boomerang.inputs keeps the swirling axe instead). Recorded against the
# tuned Colossus (wf4): stand on the slab, throw high axes whenever the head will take the hit, and a dodge (a hop or
# a step) before every attack that would reach the hero - no hit taken, all hearts left.
# Antechamber: the checkpoint, the axe, food. Drop into the arena and jump onto the slab.
